    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Embraced in Haiti into the Cult of Legba, Sangris made a desperate pact with the Decani demon Bothothel to escape Setite persecution, agreeing to funnel corrupted souls to the demon through the &quot;plague&quot; of ambition &mdash; knowing full well his own soul would eventually be forfeit. Fleeing north to escape that debt, he rose to become Archbishop of Montreal, corrupting numerous vampires and Embracing a childe, Ezekiel, whose ambition he hoped to fan to world-shattering proportions. When Inquisitor Santiago DeSoto exposed his infernalism in 1992, Sangris wove a Thaumaturgical rite into his own flesh; as the fire took him, his soul streamed into DeSoto's body while DeSoto's soul was swept away to Metathiax, a rival Decani who contested Bothothel's claim on the strength of Montreal being his own demonic prison. Sangris now lives on in secret as &quot;DeSoto,&quot; retired from the Inquisition into reclusive seclusion in Westmount, fighting constant temptation to seize power again &mdash; a temptation that would return him to Bothothel's grasp.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Present a front of calm control. Beneath it you long to return to power and save the city. It would be so easy.</p><h2>Secrets</h2><p>Sangris knows of Pierre Bellemare's infernalism and the corruption of his pack, and knows most of the city's other secrets, but using any of it would be giving in to temptation. He secretly protects his childe Ezekiel from afar even as Ezekiel rejects him.</p>",
    "notes": "Embraced 1949 (as Sangris); currently residing in the body of Santiago DeSoto since 1992. Apparent age: mid-40s. Suffers leprosy-like scarring from the duped Decani. @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.paths-of-enlightenment.JournalEntry.MkHKLOcOCLQ5pWCj]{Path of Honorable Accord} 5. Disciplines (as printed, dormant/available only if Sangris returns to infernalism, marked with * in the book): Auspex 5, Dark Thaumaturgy 5*, Dominate 5, Fortitude 2, Necromancy 5*, Obfuscate 2, Presence 5, Serpentis 5, Thaumaturgy 5 (Conjuring 3, Corruption 5, Elemental Mastery 3, Gift of Morpheus 3, Hands of Destruction 3*, Pestilence 3*, Phobos 5*, Secret Knowledge 5*, Spirit Thaumaturgy 5).",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
